q('OR100','Orders',[41],'Which factors does the course identify for assigning the default signing action to an order? Select all that apply.', ['The intended phase of care','The patient location','The number of preference cards','The inventory manufacturer'],[0,1],'The system uses phase of care and patient location to determine whether an order is for now or later. Card count and manufacturer do not drive this decision.')
