q('CLN251-252','Data structure',[41],'An analyst finds a wrong value while using Record Viewer. What can they do in that activity?', ['View the value, then use an appropriate editing tool to change it','Edit any item directly','Change the record’s security class by typing over the value','Delete the underlying contact'],[0],'Record Viewer is read-only. Identifying an item there does not make it an editing or deletion tool.')
