q('CLN251-252','Workflow Engine',[135],'The Workflow Engine rule selected through a compiled profile does not match an encounter. Does the system automatically try a lower-level profile’s rule?', ['Yes, until every profile is exhausted','No; only the selected compiled-profile rule is used','Yes, but only after posting charges','Only if the user has multiple provider records'],[1],'There is no automatic fallback through other profile-level Workflow Engine rules when conditions do not match.')
