q('CLN251-252','Roles',[169],'A user has three startup activities, two patient workspaces, and one preference-list composer open. How many workspaces count in the course example?', ['Six','Five','Four','Three'],[2],'Startup activities collectively count as one workspace. Add the two patient workspaces and the composer: four total.')
