q('CLN251-252','Security',[182],'In the course’s security model, which types are identified for every user? Select all that apply.', ['In Basket','Reporting Workbench','Shared','Inpatient'],[0,1,2],'In Basket, Reporting Workbench, and Shared apply to every user in the course model. Inpatient is for hospital clinical tools rather than every user.')
